{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "03475ce8-f1ca-8121-a3e0-ed11b5f4c4f9",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T11:17:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maureen Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:16:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:16:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, it's Maureen Doyle. I'm calling about the catch basin in front of 238 Bellevue Avenue. It's totally full of sand, from the winter road stuff, and the water just sits in the street. Since last Thursday. And it hasn't even rained."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:16:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so catch basin, 238 Bellevue, packed with sand, water pooling since last Thursday. No storm, just standing water. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. My neighbor says it happens every big rain, pero this time there's no rain at all, so it's, you know, it's not draining. Sorry, I switch languages when I'm annoyed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:17:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is that a city drain or a state one? Because Bellevue, I never know who does what, and I don't want to be sent around in circles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Most of the street drains are ours, but I'll note it and have the crew look at it. If it turns out to be state, they'll pass it along themselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:17:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, my computer fan is spinning so loud, can you hear that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:17:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little, it's fine. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:17:32-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0150."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, 401-555-0150. It's in the system, Maureen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:17:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gracias. Thanks, Kevin. Bye."
    }
  ],
